        about=[section('Our introduction','Kashyap Advisors helps students from Nepal explore study opportunities in Italy, from initial planning to settling into university life.'),section('Our story','Our work starts with a student’s goals and the questions that come with studying abroad. We bring those questions into a clear, personal plan.'),section('Our mission','Make the Italy study journey easier to understand through practical, personalised support.'),section('Our vision','Help students make informed educational choices and feel supported in a new country.'),section('Our approach','Understand your profile, explore suitable options, plan applications and stay connected through arrival.'),section('Our team','Meet an advisor at our Basundhara office to discuss your background and study plans.'),section('Why Italy','Italy combines historic academic institutions, varied study options and an international student experience.')]
